Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:52.11,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf75}隣{\kf81}に{\kf118}君{\kf20}が{\kf15}い{\kf45}れ{\kf51}ば
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:52.11,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:56.91,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}Whoa! {\kf70}High,{\kf61} {\kf102}high, {\kf113}high!
