Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:07.33,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:12.55,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf66}Ko{\kf20}e {\kf33}wa {\kf35}do{\kf96}ko {\kf66}ma{\kf56}de {\kf150}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:12.55,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf86}声{\kf33}は{\kf35}ど{\kf96}こ{\kf66}ま{\kf56}で{\kf150}も
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:12.55,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:17.76,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}Mou {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:17.76,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}もう {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:17.76,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:23.39,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ma{\kf35}i{\kf29}a{\kf37}ga{\kf28}ru {\kf33}ka{\kf32}ze {\kf66}ni {\kf54}no{\kf141}ri
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:23.39,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}舞{\kf35}い{\kf29}上{\kf37}が{\kf28}る{\kf65}風{\kf66}に{\kf54}乗{\kf141}り
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:23.39,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:27.77,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:27.77,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf45}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:27.77,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.19,0:22:33.69,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ko{\kf34}e {\kf30}mo {\kf34}to{\kf98}bi{\kf67}ha{\kf53}ne{\kf177}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.19,0:22:33.69,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.19,0:22:33.69,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go and pick out some bread and drinks for breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't listen to a word people say...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... What do we need for a cold? Water, sports drinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dairy products and the like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe some food that's easy on the stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Should we buy something for you to have for breakfast, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cereal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did she catch it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.03,0:00:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are cold germs floating around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes people catch it, and sometimes they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point worrying about who caught what from whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I pick something to take with us when we go to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put it in the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doing in the sweets aisle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! I told you to get something for breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.77,0:03:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We probably shouldn't go in, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll just be an extra worry for your mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The food's in here, so you can give it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum! Daikichi brought us food!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to what people say, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much. You've done so much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I should be thanking you after all you did for Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She went back to school today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening. It's good that you're all better, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm cooking up some of that rice porridge right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll be better in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Let's go throw my tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani-san, you might have caught this because you watched over Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:44.75,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll throw it from here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I come into contact with countless people each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:46.79,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,We're so high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:48.72,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to throw it onto that roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every day I ride a packed train to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no guarantee it came from her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:04:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least let me help with Kouki,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,even if it's just picking him up and bringing him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, we're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's play video games!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure thing, next time I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki... Make sure and help your mum, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The pudding and the smaller drink are from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding is my favourite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.49,0:06:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you up so early? It's Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I already told you! We're practising for the skipping competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's wobbly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Brush slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop wiggling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't be pushing yourself so hard yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for always taking advantage of your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one who should be saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised Kouki's having such trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He just can't seem to get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The jump rope whirls around like this, so you should be jumping here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So why are you moving your legs and arms at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your move your arms first, and then your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First, try it slowly once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Me, too! Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your problem is that you're swinging your arms in circles that are too big, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your arms in like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're early!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see why they're so fired up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu-kun's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's because he has a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He has someone to learn everything from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to join in, Sayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She just lost one of her upper teeth, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard being a girl, huh? Even as a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan... What sort of container do you hold your teeth in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did your parents get you a cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know? There are cases that you can put your kid's old baby teeth in as a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A memento?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have these cute tiny ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.74,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:21.78,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Mine's a butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.19,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I bought one for Kouki, too, but he doesn't save his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin would love one of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm an idiot! I should've known there'd be something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since I've met Rin, every day's been like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,freaking out and fussing over the tiniest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, this is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.47,0:08:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I drew it in school!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had to write about a member of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You put your baby teeth in it when they fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As a little keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A keepsake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun's mum! {XD Yes, this sounds weird in Japanese too}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that Kouki's?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I throw mine! {XD!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.23,0:09:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've thrown all of mine on the roof until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.73,0:09:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can throw them or keep them. It's up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin. I'm going to give skipping my all next time, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're poking at your tooth again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you leave it alone, it'll come out on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, either way, she's going to look like someone punched her lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She won't be able to smile, at very least...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you grown taller again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You're going to do it, too, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to pick up a little excess weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough when you get older, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to nip it in the bud, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san's doing it like a boxer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is easier on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Teach me how to do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No fair! How come only you get to look cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to learn to do it normally first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.91,0:10:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.89,0:10:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too! Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! That's amazing! You can do it backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.34,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Kids sure are amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have so much energy, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rock! Paper! Scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.51,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know where they get it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though adults are pretty amazing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you already know, but I'm not Rin's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We only started living together a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before that, I spent all of my time just thinking about myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but once I met her, my whole lifestyle changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have been with your kids your whole lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm still pretty new to this, so it's not really a big deal yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm wondering if it's really possible to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...never having any real alone time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin... Wasn't today the skipping competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many skips did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.18,0:12:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's terri{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two hundred and three! {:D :D :D :D}{SO CUTE}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can do that many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that got you... first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's the certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure did well! This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.39,0:12:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I could've done way better on forward jumping...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you did only get one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're really good at it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that, even if they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I lost weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!{CUTECUTECUTE}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we almost there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... About ten more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll want to see that wobbly tooth of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I keep telling you not to touch it unless you need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll show them my skipping, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown so much recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Mum and Dad are going to get a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'm taller than Auntie now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you've grown {\i1}that{\i0} much...{I always forget the italics code. I'm lame. :'D}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to go and fill Granddad in on things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin-chan! I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you one of the the biggest in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should have called! I would have come to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is capable of walking for ten minutes, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to be taller than me soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Kazumi-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo. You're here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I arrived a while before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie sent them to me a while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, let me see your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two of the front teeth are wobbly just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? It doesn't hurt, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It hurts a little sometimes, but I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a pro! {What? XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do anything to help her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her gums are all red!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a little swelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, when I was younger, you said you'd pull out mine with thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.37,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,With thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My! I don't quite remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to make everything easy to chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want some freeze-dried tofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have some beans, too, Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just eat up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I love freeze-dried tofu! {I hate the name of this. It's so awkward. :'D But I don't know another word for it in English. XD}{what is it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did it fall out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blood! Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum! A tissue! A tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.07,0:16:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, use this for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a dust cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.27,0:16:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan has changed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe she's always been like that on the inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're getting married, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum told me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.61,0:16:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice. She said that he seemed like a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The only problem is that he wants kids straight away...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No going out drinking. No concerts. No holidays. No good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be able to do anything anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.49,0:16:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you should be talking to him about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's not much I can say...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not even into kids to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't want to become one of those obnoxious mums!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I could sacrifice myself just to raise a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I think you'd make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you really wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess when the kid's already there, you don't really have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's easy for you to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what it's like to be a husband. Nor a father. Nor a mother, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I might not have time to go shopping or sit around drinking tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but my time at work is my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.74,0:17:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my time with my son is my own, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of it is precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think there's any special trick to being a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heck, the world's full of people just like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Granddad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My adult teeth are starting to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say, "Cheese!"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That vase...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! The other one feels like it's going to come out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mirror! Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that I'll go on fussing and worrying over the smallest things...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though that's probably true of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look! {SO CUTE!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? You look like a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.74,0:20:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send a text to your parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:54.13,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,A photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:21:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever else happens, I feel like I'll go on being happy when I see her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I think things are just fine like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:50.67,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\fs72\b1\c&H505756&\fscy80\fscx90\pos(704,504)}{8:37}Daikichi makes really good beef\N and potatoes. And he can run fast. {paragraph}
